/* Termination of a single loop that havocs a variable, the shape of the
   TermCOMP ITS file From_T2/bf15.t2_fixed:
     i = 0; while (i < n) { x = nondet(); i++; }
   Valid.  Erasing the self-call's quantifier makes a fresh copy of L that
   replaces L in the recursion (L itself is left calling the copy once), so the
   problem keeps one recursion. */
forall (n: int) (x: int). L 0 n x
s.t.
L (i: int) (n: int) (x: int): bool =mu i >= n \/ (forall (x': int). L (i + 1) n x');
